  <LegalContent>
    <p>Welcome to WAYGGO Charters.</p>
    <p>WAYGGO helps travel professionals, organizations, businesses, and groups coordinate ground transportation across the United States and Canada through a network of transportation operators and service partners.</p>
    <p>Our role is fundamentally about coordination.</p>
    <p>A successful journey depends on clear information, appropriate transportation, reliable communication, and each party understanding its responsibilities.</p>
    <p>These Terms of Service establish the framework for using WAYGGO's website and services and for working with WAYGGO in connection with transportation arrangements.</p>
    <p>Please read these Terms carefully.</p>
    <p>By using the WAYGGO website, requesting services, creating an account where applicable, submitting a transportation inquiry, making a booking, or otherwise using WAYGGO services, you agree to these Terms to the extent applicable to your relationship with WAYGGO.</p>
    <p>If you do not agree with these Terms, please do not use the applicable WAYGGO services.</p>

    <h2>About WAYGGO</h2>
    <p>WAYGGO Charters Inc. (“WAYGGO,” “we,” “our,” or “us”) provides transportation coordination and related services for group travel.</p>
    <p>WAYGGO may work with independent transportation companies, charter operators, drivers, technology providers, and other service providers to fulfill transportation requirements.</p>
    <p>Depending on the arrangement, WAYGGO may coordinate transportation between a customer and a transportation operator rather than directly operating the vehicle used for a particular trip.</p>
    <p>This distinction is important.</p>
    <p>When you work with WAYGGO, you are engaging a transportation coordination relationship designed to make group transportation easier to manage across destinations.</p>

    <h2>Who These Terms Apply To</h2>
    <p>These Terms may apply to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Customers</li>
      <li>Tour operators</li>
      <li>Travel agencies</li>
      <li>Destination management companies</li>
      <li>Corporate travel planners</li>
      <li>Event organizers</li>
      <li>Wedding planners</li>
      <li>Schools and educational organizations</li>
      <li>Religious organizations</li>
      <li>Sports organizations</li>
      <li>Other group travel organizers</li>
      <li>Transportation partners</li>
      <li>Website visitors</li>
      <li>Other users of WAYGGO services</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Certain provisions may apply differently depending on the nature of the relationship.</p>
    <p>Additional written agreements, booking confirmations, invoices, partner agreements, or service-specific terms may apply to particular transactions.</p>
    <p>Where a specific written agreement conflicts with these Terms, the specific agreement will control to the extent stated in that agreement.</p>

    <h2>Using the WAYGGO Website</h2>
    <p>You agree to use the WAYGGO website lawfully and responsibly. You may not:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Use the website for unlawful purposes</li>
      <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to systems or information</li>
