    <p>When contacting WAYGGO about a specific transportation arrangement, please include the relevant booking or quote information where available.</p>
    <p>Clear communication helps us resolve questions more efficiently.</p>

    <h2>Our Approach to the Relationship</h2>
    <p>WAYGGO exists to make group transportation easier to coordinate. That requires more than providing vehicles.</p>
    <p>It requires customers to provide accurate information, transportation partners to fulfill their responsibilities, travelers to follow reasonable safety requirements, and WAYGGO to coordinate the relationship between them.</p>
    <p>These Terms are intended to make those responsibilities clear.</p>
    <p>They are not designed to make the transportation relationship unnecessarily complicated.</p>
    <p>The principle behind them is simple:</p>
    <p><strong>Clear information. Clear responsibilities. Clear communication.</strong></p>
    <p><strong>A coordinated transportation relationship.</strong></p>
    <p>That is how WAYGGO works to make group transportation easier to manage.</p>
    <p><strong>One relationship. A coordinated way to move the group.</strong></p>
